[2026-03-14T20:18:17.847Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LNVNgAgCQ7h9PXsinS51jT","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive summary document.\n\n## Summary: Booking Navigation and Testing Guide\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the GoogleFlights codebase, here's everything you need to write tests that navigate to the booking page:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **URL Pattern for Booking Page**\n\n**Route Definition** (from `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`):\n```\n/booking/:id\n```\n\n**Full URL Format with Parameters:**\n```\n/booking/{flightId}?cabin={cabinClass}&adults={num}&children={num}&infants={num}&returnFlight={returnFlightId}\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n/booking/abc123?cabin=economy&adults=1&children=0&infants=0\n/booking/abc123?cabin=business&adults=2&children=1&infants=0&returnFlight=def456\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Component: FlightDetailsPage (The Booking Page)**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/FlightDetailsPage.tsx`\n\n**Key Behaviors:**\n- Accepts `flightId` from URL params\n- Reads query parameters: `cabin`, `adults`, `children`, `infants`, `returnFlight`\n- Dispatches `fetchFlightForBooking` thunk with `flightId` and `cabinClass`\n- If `returnFlight` param exists, also dispatches `fetchReturnFlightForBooking`\n- Calls `initializePassengers` action to set up passenger forms\n- Shows loading state, error state, and full booking form when data loads\n- Displays `FlightSummary`, `PassengerForm`, `PriceBreakdown`, and `BookingAction` components\n\n**Test IDs Available:**\n- `flight-details-page` - main container\n- `flight-details-loading` - loading state\n- `flight-details-error` - error state\n- `flight-details-back` - back button\n- `return-flight-section` - only visible if roundtrip\n- `view-trips-button` - shown after successful booking\n\n---\n\n### 3. **How to Initialize Passengers - The `initializePassengers` Thunk**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n\n**Action Definition:**\n```typescript\ninitializePassengers(state, action: PayloadAction<{ adults: number; children: number; infants: number }>)\n```\n\n**What It Does:**\n- Creates empty passenger objects based on counts\n- Sets `passengerType` field: `'adult' | 'child' | 'infant'`\n- Resets validation errors and booking state\n\n**Passenger Structure Created:**\n```typescript\ninterface PassengerInfo {\n  firstName: string\n  lastName: string\n  dateOfBirth: string\n  gender: string\n  email: string\n  phone: string\n  passengerType: 'adult' | 'child' | 'infant'\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. **The `createBooking` Thunk**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/bookings`\n\n**Request Payload:**\n```typescript\n{\n  sessionToken: string        // Required: from localStorage\n  flightId: string           // Required\n  returnFlightId?: string    // Optional for round trips\n  cabinClass: string         // 'economy', 'premium_economy', 'business', 'first'\n  totalPriceCents: number    // Total price in cents\n  passengers: Array<{\n    firstName: string\n    lastName: string\n    dateOfBirth: string\n    gender: string\n    email?: string\n    phone?: string\n    passengerType: string\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n**Success Response:**\n```typescript\n{\n  id: string\n  bookingReference: string    // Format: \"GF-XXXXXX\"\n  status: string              // \"confirmed\"\n  createdAt: string\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. **My-Bookings Netlify Function (Fetch Bookings)**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts`\n\n**GET Request:**\n```\nGET /api/my-bookings?session={sessionToken}\n```\n\n**Returns:** Array of bookings with trip details (flights, prices, passengers)\n\n**PATCH Request (Cancel):**\n```\nPATCH /api/my-bookings\nBody: { bookingId: string, sessionToken: string, status: 'cancelled' }\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Seed Data Available**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Key Flight Routes Created:**\n- LAX ↔ JFK (multiple airlines, various prices)\n- JFK ↔ LHR (international, overnight flights)\n- SFO ↔ JFK (23 flights for pagination testing)\n- SFO ↔ NRT (Tokyo, long-haul)\n- Many domestic routes (ORD, DEN, ATL, MIA, etc.)\n\n**Specific Test Flights:**\n- `AA100`: LAX→JFK, 5h 30m, nonstop, wifi=true, power=true\n- `DL200`: LAX→JFK, Delta, 5h 30m\n- `AA101`: LAX→DFW→JFK, 1 stop, 7h (stops data available)\n- `B6400`: LAX→JFK, Airbus A321, wifi=true, power=true, entertainment=false\n- `BA100`: JFK→LHR, 19:00-07:00+1 (overnight)\n\n**Sample Booking (Session Token: `seed-session-token`):**\n- `GF-ABC123`: AA100, economy, $343.85, confirmed status\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Test Pattern (from Existing Tests)**\n\n**From `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/flight-summary.spec.ts`:**\n\n```typescript\n// 1. Helper function to navigate to booking page\nasync function navigateToBookingPage(\n  page: Page,\n  options: {\n    origin?: string          // default 'LAX'\n    destination?: string     // default 'JFK'\n    departureDate?: string   // default '2026-04-01'\n    cabinClass?: string      // default 'economy'\n    adults?: string          // default '1'\n    children?: string        // default '0'\n    infants?: string         // default '0'\n    returnDate?: string      // default '2026-04-08'\n    flightNumber?: string    // optional, searches for specific flight\n    returnFlightId?: string  // optional, for round trips\n  } = {}\n) {\n  // Navigate to search results\n  await page.goto(buildResultsUrl({\n    origin: options.origin,\n    destination: options.destination,\n    // ... other params\n  }))\n  \n  // Find flight card and extract ID from data-testid\n  const card = page.locator('[data-testid^=\"flight-card-main-\"]').first()\n  const testId = await card.getAttribute('data-testid')\n  const flightId = testId!.replace('flight-card-main-', '')\n  \n  // Navigate to booking page\n  await page.goto(`/booking/${flightId}?${bookingParams}`)\n  await expect(page.getByTestId('flight-details-page')).toBeVisible()\n  \n  return flightId\n}\n\n// 2. Usage in test\ntest('example booking test', async ({ page }) => {\n  await navigateToBookingPage(page, { flightNumber: 'AA100' })\n  \n  // Now test passenger form, submission, etc.\n  await page.getByTestId('passenger-form-first-name-0').fill('John')\n  // ...\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. **Session Management**\n\n**From `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx`:**\n\nSession tokens are stored in localStorage:\n```typescript\nfunction getSessionToken(): string {\n  let token = localStorage.getItem('session_token')\n  if (!token) {\n    token = crypto.randomUUID()\n    localStorage.setItem('session_token', token)\n  }\n  return token\n}\n```\n\n**For Testing:**\n- Tests automatically get/create a session token via localStorage\n- Session is automatically persisted across page navigations\n- Use this token when calling `createBooking` thunk\n\n---\n\n### 9. **Key Test IDs Available**\n\n**Booking Page Elements:**\n- `flight-details-page` - main booking page\n- `flight-summary` - flight details component\n- `flight-summary-label` - \"Outbound · LAX → JFK\"\n- `flight-summary-leg-{n}` - individual flight legs\n- `flight-summary-stops` - stops indicator\n- `flight-summary-duration` - total duration\n- `return-flight-section` - only for round trips\n\n**Form Elements:**\n- `passenger-form` - passenger form section\n- `booking-action` - submit booking button\n- `price-breakdown` - price details\n- `price-breakdown-total` - final total price\n\n---\n\n### 10. **Exact URL Navigation Examples**\n\n```typescript\n// Simple one-way booking page for first available flight\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-123?cabin=economy&adults=1&children=0&infants=0')\n\n// Round trip with 2 adults, 1 child\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-123?cabin=economy&adults=2&children=1&infants=0&returnFlight=return-uuid-456')\n\n// Business class with special passengers\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-789?cabin=business&adults=1&children=2&infants=1&returnFlight=return-uuid-999')\n```\n\n---\n\n**All Files Referenced:**\n- App routing: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`\n- Booking page component: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/FlightDetailsPage.tsx`\n- Redux slice: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n- Bookings API: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n- My-bookings API: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts`\n- Test pattern reference: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/flight-summary.spec.ts`\n- Seed data: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a71f0acbe3829a618 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 66386\ntool_uses: 24\nduration_ms: 38063</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19b0156b-6b8d-4bf8-87d9-d30f04f0aedb","uuid":"4e4544c6-e18a-461b-b199-3e89435df276","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/GoogleFlights, I need to understand:\n1. How to navigate to the booking page - read the BookingPage component in src/pages/\n2. Read the routing setup (App.tsx or similar) to understand URL patterns\n3. Read the bookingSlice.ts to understand initializePassengers and createBooking thunks\n4. Read the my-bookings.ts netlify function\n5. Read the TripCard component\n6. Read the MyTripsPage component\n7. Read an existing test file (e.g., tests/search-button.spec.ts) to see the test pattern used\n8. Read the seed-db.ts to understand what seed data exists for flights\n\nI need to write tests that navigate to the booking page. I need the exact URL pattern and how to set up passengers.","agentId":"a71f0acbe3829a618","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive summary document.\n\n## Summary: Booking Navigation and Testing Guide\n\nBased on my thorough exploration of the GoogleFlights codebase, here's everything you need to write tests that navigate to the booking page:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **URL Pattern for Booking Page**\n\n**Route Definition** (from `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`):\n```\n/booking/:id\n```\n\n**Full URL Format with Parameters:**\n```\n/booking/{flightId}?cabin={cabinClass}&adults={num}&children={num}&infants={num}&returnFlight={returnFlightId}\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n/booking/abc123?cabin=economy&adults=1&children=0&infants=0\n/booking/abc123?cabin=business&adults=2&children=1&infants=0&returnFlight=def456\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. **Component: FlightDetailsPage (The Booking Page)**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/FlightDetailsPage.tsx`\n\n**Key Behaviors:**\n- Accepts `flightId` from URL params\n- Reads query parameters: `cabin`, `adults`, `children`, `infants`, `returnFlight`\n- Dispatches `fetchFlightForBooking` thunk with `flightId` and `cabinClass`\n- If `returnFlight` param exists, also dispatches `fetchReturnFlightForBooking`\n- Calls `initializePassengers` action to set up passenger forms\n- Shows loading state, error state, and full booking form when data loads\n- Displays `FlightSummary`, `PassengerForm`, `PriceBreakdown`, and `BookingAction` components\n\n**Test IDs Available:**\n- `flight-details-page` - main container\n- `flight-details-loading` - loading state\n- `flight-details-error` - error state\n- `flight-details-back` - back button\n- `return-flight-section` - only visible if roundtrip\n- `view-trips-button` - shown after successful booking\n\n---\n\n### 3. **How to Initialize Passengers - The `initializePassengers` Thunk**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n\n**Action Definition:**\n```typescript\ninitializePassengers(state, action: PayloadAction<{ adults: number; children: number; infants: number }>)\n```\n\n**What It Does:**\n- Creates empty passenger objects based on counts\n- Sets `passengerType` field: `'adult' | 'child' | 'infant'`\n- Resets validation errors and booking state\n\n**Passenger Structure Created:**\n```typescript\ninterface PassengerInfo {\n  firstName: string\n  lastName: string\n  dateOfBirth: string\n  gender: string\n  email: string\n  phone: string\n  passengerType: 'adult' | 'child' | 'infant'\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. **The `createBooking` Thunk**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST /api/bookings`\n\n**Request Payload:**\n```typescript\n{\n  sessionToken: string        // Required: from localStorage\n  flightId: string           // Required\n  returnFlightId?: string    // Optional for round trips\n  cabinClass: string         // 'economy', 'premium_economy', 'business', 'first'\n  totalPriceCents: number    // Total price in cents\n  passengers: Array<{\n    firstName: string\n    lastName: string\n    dateOfBirth: string\n    gender: string\n    email?: string\n    phone?: string\n    passengerType: string\n  }>\n}\n```\n\n**Success Response:**\n```typescript\n{\n  id: string\n  bookingReference: string    // Format: \"GF-XXXXXX\"\n  status: string              // \"confirmed\"\n  createdAt: string\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. **My-Bookings Netlify Function (Fetch Bookings)**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts`\n\n**GET Request:**\n```\nGET /api/my-bookings?session={sessionToken}\n```\n\n**Returns:** Array of bookings with trip details (flights, prices, passengers)\n\n**PATCH Request (Cancel):**\n```\nPATCH /api/my-bookings\nBody: { bookingId: string, sessionToken: string, status: 'cancelled' }\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. **Seed Data Available**\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n\n**Key Flight Routes Created:**\n- LAX ↔ JFK (multiple airlines, various prices)\n- JFK ↔ LHR (international, overnight flights)\n- SFO ↔ JFK (23 flights for pagination testing)\n- SFO ↔ NRT (Tokyo, long-haul)\n- Many domestic routes (ORD, DEN, ATL, MIA, etc.)\n\n**Specific Test Flights:**\n- `AA100`: LAX→JFK, 5h 30m, nonstop, wifi=true, power=true\n- `DL200`: LAX→JFK, Delta, 5h 30m\n- `AA101`: LAX→DFW→JFK, 1 stop, 7h (stops data available)\n- `B6400`: LAX→JFK, Airbus A321, wifi=true, power=true, entertainment=false\n- `BA100`: JFK→LHR, 19:00-07:00+1 (overnight)\n\n**Sample Booking (Session Token: `seed-session-token`):**\n- `GF-ABC123`: AA100, economy, $343.85, confirmed status\n\n---\n\n### 7. **Test Pattern (from Existing Tests)**\n\n**From `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/flight-summary.spec.ts`:**\n\n```typescript\n// 1. Helper function to navigate to booking page\nasync function navigateToBookingPage(\n  page: Page,\n  options: {\n    origin?: string          // default 'LAX'\n    destination?: string     // default 'JFK'\n    departureDate?: string   // default '2026-04-01'\n    cabinClass?: string      // default 'economy'\n    adults?: string          // default '1'\n    children?: string        // default '0'\n    infants?: string         // default '0'\n    returnDate?: string      // default '2026-04-08'\n    flightNumber?: string    // optional, searches for specific flight\n    returnFlightId?: string  // optional, for round trips\n  } = {}\n) {\n  // Navigate to search results\n  await page.goto(buildResultsUrl({\n    origin: options.origin,\n    destination: options.destination,\n    // ... other params\n  }))\n  \n  // Find flight card and extract ID from data-testid\n  const card = page.locator('[data-testid^=\"flight-card-main-\"]').first()\n  const testId = await card.getAttribute('data-testid')\n  const flightId = testId!.replace('flight-card-main-', '')\n  \n  // Navigate to booking page\n  await page.goto(`/booking/${flightId}?${bookingParams}`)\n  await expect(page.getByTestId('flight-details-page')).toBeVisible()\n  \n  return flightId\n}\n\n// 2. Usage in test\ntest('example booking test', async ({ page }) => {\n  await navigateToBookingPage(page, { flightNumber: 'AA100' })\n  \n  // Now test passenger form, submission, etc.\n  await page.getByTestId('passenger-form-first-name-0').fill('John')\n  // ...\n})\n```\n\n---\n\n### 8. **Session Management**\n\n**From `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/MyTripsPage.tsx`:**\n\nSession tokens are stored in localStorage:\n```typescript\nfunction getSessionToken(): string {\n  let token = localStorage.getItem('session_token')\n  if (!token) {\n    token = crypto.randomUUID()\n    localStorage.setItem('session_token', token)\n  }\n  return token\n}\n```\n\n**For Testing:**\n- Tests automatically get/create a session token via localStorage\n- Session is automatically persisted across page navigations\n- Use this token when calling `createBooking` thunk\n\n---\n\n### 9. **Key Test IDs Available**\n\n**Booking Page Elements:**\n- `flight-details-page` - main booking page\n- `flight-summary` - flight details component\n- `flight-summary-label` - \"Outbound · LAX → JFK\"\n- `flight-summary-leg-{n}` - individual flight legs\n- `flight-summary-stops` - stops indicator\n- `flight-summary-duration` - total duration\n- `return-flight-section` - only for round trips\n\n**Form Elements:**\n- `passenger-form` - passenger form section\n- `booking-action` - submit booking button\n- `price-breakdown` - price details\n- `price-breakdown-total` - final total price\n\n---\n\n### 10. **Exact URL Navigation Examples**\n\n```typescript\n// Simple one-way booking page for first available flight\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-123?cabin=economy&adults=1&children=0&infants=0')\n\n// Round trip with 2 adults, 1 child\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-123?cabin=economy&adults=2&children=1&infants=0&returnFlight=return-uuid-456')\n\n// Business class with special passengers\nawait page.goto('/booking/flight-uuid-789?cabin=business&adults=1&children=2&infants=1&returnFlight=return-uuid-999')\n```\n\n---\n\n**All Files Referenced:**\n- App routing: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/App.tsx`\n- Booking page component: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/pages/FlightDetailsPage.tsx`\n- Redux slice: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/slices/bookingSlice.ts`\n- Bookings API: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/bookings.ts`\n- My-bookings API: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/netlify/functions/my-bookings.ts`\n- Test pattern reference: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/tests/flight-summary.spec.ts`\n- Seed data: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/scripts/seed-db.ts`"}],"totalDurationMs":38063,"totalTokens":66386,"totalToolUseCount":24,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7455,"cache_read_input_tokens":56324,"output_tokens":2603,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7455},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
